    {
      "id": "p0151-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During the date and hangout sequences, Papyrus mentions that his outfit contains a special secret. The player is then asked to identify that secret. If the player checks Papyrus' shoes in the English game, Papyrus responds with:",
        "raw": "During the date and hangout sequences, Papyrus mentions that his outfit\ncontains a special secret. The player is then asked to identify that secret. If the\nplayer checks Papyrus' shoes in the English game, Papyrus responds with:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09308965,
          0.23301429,
          0.69663722,
          0.28271429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08963051,
          0.2323,
          0.708386,
          0.28378571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          8,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "约会和一起玩耍时，Papyrus 会说自己的装束里藏着一个特别的秘密，请玩家找出来。英语版中，如果调查他的鞋子，他会回答：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
