    {
      "id": "p0151-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This line includes a pun on the English words \"soul\" and \"sole\". The Japanese equivalents of these words don't share the same pronunciation, though, so the joke would be lost in a straightforward translation.",
        "raw": "This line includes a pun on the English words \"soul\" and \"sole\". The Japanese\nequivalents of these words don't share the same pronunciation, though, so the\njoke would be lost in a straightforward translation.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09252677,
          0.36138571,
          0.69524538,
          0.41108571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08963051,
          0.36067143,
          0.708386,
          0.41215714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          14,
          15,
          16
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这句台词利用了英语 soul（灵魂）与 sole（鞋底）的同音。相应的日语词发音并不相同，所以直译会丢掉这个笑话。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09276727,
          0.35995714,
          0.70633917,
          0.41465714
        ],
